1521.           * rank guard (verifier e1_v1): on a rank-deficient posted VCE, 
> -test- silently
.           * drops redundant constraints and reports a residual-rank p where
.           * contrast(overjoint) reported missing (a silent "." -> 0.0000 flip
> ). when the
.           * chain test is not provably full rank, defer to the old contrast e
> ngine so
