> rgetflag') subpop(if `ifstatement' & `targetflag'==1 & `t' < `ttre' & `_t' !=
>  0 & `ttre' != .) noestimcheck over(`subgroups') contrast(overjoint)  `poisma
> rginstext' `marginsdof'
1568.                 cap local prejoint_`item'_sdiff = r(p)[1,2]
1569.                 if _rc != 0 local prejoint_`item'_sdiff
1570.               }
1571.             }
