> dard errors were not identified for `evpostmiss' of `evposttotal' reported es
> timates, so no variance-covariance matrix e(V) was posted. Point estimates re
> main in e(b); per-estimate results remain in e(wdidmainresults) and the displ
> ayed tables."
2163.       if `evpostmiss' == 0 dis as text "Caution: wooldid could not post a
>  variance-covariance matrix e(V) for this run. Per-estimate results remain in
>  e(wdidmainresults) and the displayed tables."
2164.     }
2165.   }
