> es_`ptpty')/e(V_es_`ptpty')/e(numpre_`ptpty') to Roth's pretrends package."
190.     dis as result "    weighted mean post-treatment relative period (hbar)
>  = " %-9.0g `ptphbar'
191.     dis as result "    minimum detectable linear trend, and the bias such 
