> t", "ame", .)
200.         dis as text "    note: this `ptpty'-weighted diagnostic stands in 
> for the requested `ptpsurr' estimand(s); its hbar and bias columns use `ptpty
> ' post-period weights."
201.       }
202.     }
203.     matlist `ptpmat', format(%12.4g)
204.     dis as text "    note: mdt_wald powers the joint pre-trend test above;
>  mdt_nis powers the test that any"
205.     dis as text "    pre-period coefficient is individually significant (t
> he convention of Roth's pretrends package)."
206.     if "`pois'" == "poisson" & "`poisexp'" == "" dis as text "    note: po
> isson event-study coefficients are on the linear-index (xb) scale, and so are
>  these diagnostics."
