218.   }
219.   if `ptpheader' == 0 dis as text "Caution: pretrendpower() was requested,
>  but no event-study coefficient vector with a valid variance-covariance matri
> x was available (e.g. under timetrends); no diagnostics were computed."
220.   * completion marker: the caller runs this program under cap noi and ever
> y ereturn
.   * above is individually cap'd, so an abort partway through the type loop wo
> uld leave
.   * the earlier types' roth_* returns in e() with nothing marking the run inc
> omplete.
.   * e(roth_ok) is set only here, after the loop has finished; any roth_* retu
> rn present
.   * without e(roth_ok) therefore identifies a partially populated diagnostics
