. cap prog drop wooldid_display

. prog def wooldid_display
  1. version 16.0
  2.   syntax , part(string)
  3.   * replay contract gate: e(wdid_replayv) is the version of the display co
> ntract the
.   * store was written under. bump the posted value (in wooldid_worker) whenev
> er the
.   * display contract changes; the exact match here refuses cross-version repl
> ays
.   * instead of misrendering a store this code no longer understands
.   if "`e(wdid_replayv)'" != "1" {
  4.     dis as error "Error: the stored results were posted by a wooldid versi
> on without replay support or with a different replay contract (e(wdid_replayv
> )='`e(wdid_replayv)'', this version requires '1'); nothing can be redisplayed
> . Refit wooldid."
  5.     error 301
  6.   }
  7.   * NFRPL-03: mirror wooldid_esplots' existence guard - on a corrupt/fabri
> cated store the
.   * matlist below would otherwise render a synthetic 1x1 "." table (an absent
>  e() matrix
.   * reads as a missing scalar). every genuine wooldid post carries the matrix
> , so this
.   * cannot fire on a valid store. scope decision (deliberate, realistic-vs-pa
> thological):
.   * the central matrix only - the summarystats/wdidsgresults/pwsgs matlist si
> tes remain
.   * fabrication-exposed
.   cap confirm matrix e(wdidmainresults)
  8.   if _rc != 0 {
  9.     dis as error "Error: the stored results no longer contain e(wdidmainre
> sults); rerun wooldid."
 10.     error 301
 11.   }
 12. 
.   * rehydrate the display state from e(). each local below mirrors the worker
>  local of
.   * the same meaning byte-for-byte: option/label strings come from the hidden
>  wdid_*
.   * macros (string-exact by construction), data-derived values from posted e(
> ) scalars
.   * (locals were themselves "= e(...)" evaluations upstream, so re-evaluating
>  here
.   * reproduces the same strings, including "." for a never-set value)
