. * F11: event-study plots, moved out of wooldid_worker (per-program size ceili
> ng). reads
. * e() plus the two per-call options only; runs inside its own tempname frame 
> and returns
. * to the caller's frame on the normal path. on an error inside this program, 
> stata
. * auto-drops the tempname frame and the wooldid shell's rc-gated epilogue res
> tores the
. * caller's frame - the same net behavior as the pre-F11 inline code.
. cap prog drop wooldid_esplots

. prog def wooldid_esplots
  1. version 16.0
  2.   syntax [, SAVEplots(name) replace]
  3.   * guard the hand-call surface: without a posted wooldid result, the body
>  would die
.   * later inside its own tempname frame with a misleading "relyr not found" (
> an absent
.   * e() matrix silently reads as a 1x1 missing scalar), stranding a caller wh
> o typed
.   * this directly from a non-default frame in the default frame
.   * exact-match on the replay contract version, mirroring the wooldid_display
>  gate
.   if "`e(wdid_replayv)'" != "1" {
  4.     dis as error "Error: wooldid_esplots is internal to wooldid and needs 
> a stored wooldid estimation (replay contract '1') in e(); run wooldid first."
  5.     error 301
  6.   }
  7.   cap confirm matrix e(wdidmainresults)
  8.   if _rc != 0 {
  9.     dis as error "Error: the stored results no longer contain e(wdidmainre
> sults); rerun wooldid."
 10.     error 301
 11.   }
 12.   qui frame
 13.   local defaultframe `r(currentframe)'
 14. 
.   * rehydrate what the plot code reads from e()
.   local y `e(depvar)'
 15.   local esrelativeto `e(wdid_esrel)'
 16.   local timetrends `e(wdid_timetrends)'
 17.   local semielasticity `e(wdid_semielas)'
