> iod esfixedbaseperiod
 24.   tempname wdidpooled
 25.   matrix `wdidpooled' = e(wdidmainresults)
 26. 
. 
. 
.     * this creates and enters a frame where we will produce graphs using wdid
> pooled and similar for sgs
